      "slug": "rekuperation-education",
      "title": "Rekuperation — E-Mobility Education",
      "description": "Animated learning video on regenerative braking for the German Academy of Digital Education, developed with the editorial team and Tesla expert Harald Schlarb. Blender assets and Unreal Engine scenes turn recuperation into clear 3D visuals—vehicle setups, energy flows, braking, and battery cues—for students.",
